{
  "date": "2026-05-29",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "모해",
      "en": "What are you doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "리이브에서 봤겠지만",
      "en": "You probably saw it on Live,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 은발이 되었어용",
      "en": "but I've gone silver-haired~"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "장산범이야?",
      "en": "Are you the Jangsan Tiger spirit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "야",
      "en": "Hey."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 은발에 단발 하니까 다들 너무 좋아하는거야",
      "en": "Everyone loved it when I had silver hair with a short bob."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서 아 ~이렇게 활동 해버릴까",
      "en": "So I was like, 'Maybe I should just promote like this.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "했는데",
      "en": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "채연언니가 자꾸",
      "en": "Chaeyeon unnie kept"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "삽살개?",
      "en": "calling me a shaggy dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "같다고 놀림",
      "en": "She kept teasing me about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 색빠지면 다시 금발 될듯",
      "en": "But once the color fades, it'll probably turn blonde again."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "낼 무슨머리할까",
      "en": "What hairstyle should I do tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "단발 장발 고민중",
      "en": "I'm deciding between short hair and long hair."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "단발 반응이 파격적이였어 오늘",
      "en": "The reaction to the short hair today was incredible."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서 고민중",
      "en": "So I'm really thinking about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "머야",
      "en": "Wait..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "거의 장발이라 하네…",
      "en": "Almost everyone's saying long hair..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아람서.:.",
      "en": "I see..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋㅋㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "사실 답정너긴해",
      "en": "Honestly... I kind of already have an answer in mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "낼 상황보고 결정해볼게",
      "en": "I'll see how things are tomorrow and decide."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅎㅎ",
      "en": "ㅎㅎ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이 이번 앨범 최애곡 뭐야!!!!",
      "en": "Hayeon, what's your favorite song on this album!!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나는 sleek",
      "en": "For me, it's 'Sleek.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이유는",
      "en": "The reason is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내파트가 맘에들어",
      "en": "I really like my part."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "스포하자면",
      "en": "As a little spoiler..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "랩?",
      "en": "Rap?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아",
      "en": "Ah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "새드걸 그게 더 좋다",
      "en": "Actually, I like 'Sad Girl' even more."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내파트",
      "en": "My part in that song."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "멤버들도 다",
      "en": "The members all"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그부분 좋아해줘",
      "en": "said they liked that part."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나만 소화할수있는 느낌이 있다고해써",
      "en": "They said it has a vibe that only I can pull off."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "노래도 노랜데",
      "en": "The song is great too, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭐",
      "en": "Well..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "응",
      "en": "Yeah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘 봫",
      "en": "Just watch carefully."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 몰랑",
      "en": "Ah, whatever~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "와 너무 졸려",
      "en": "Wow, I'm so sleepy."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "미치겠당",
      "en": "I'm going crazy."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "아까 차에서 잤다매 유빈이 다리 잡고",
      "en": "Didn't you sleep in the car earlier while holding onto Yubin's leg?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ 맞아",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "우리 다 촬영 중간중간",
      "en": "All of us kept"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "기절했다 깨어나고 반복했어",
      "en": "passing out and waking up between shoots."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 유빈언니 앞자리였는데",
      "en": "I was sitting in front of Yubin unnie,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내 얼굴쪽으로 다리 올리능거",
      "en": "and she stretched her legs toward my face."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서 걍 목배게마냥",
      "en": "So I just used them like a neck pillow"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잡고 잤어",
      "en": "and fell asleep."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "차에서 화장지우고",
      "en": "I took my makeup off in the car,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "언니가 로션발라주면서",
      "en": "and unnie put lotion on me"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "얼굴마사지도 해줌",
      "en": "and even gave me a face massage."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뒤에서 ㅋㅎㅋㄹㅋㅎㄹㅋㅋ",
      "en": "From the back seat: ㅋㅎㅋㄹㅋㅎㄹㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "날 너무 좋아해~",
      "en": "Everyone likes me too much~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "김채원 김수민 공유빈 나 두고 싸우지망 경고양!!",
      "en": "Kim Chaewon, Kim Soomin, Gong Yubin—stop fighting over me! That's your warning!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 두고 질투한다고 진진진",
      "en": "They're seriously, seriously, seriously jealous over me."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이 내껀데 셋이 싸워서 뭐하지",
      "en": "But Hayeon, you're mine, so what are the three of them fighting over?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ 그러네",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ You're right."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "Y/n껀데",
      "en": "I belong to Y/n after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘 자구",
      "en": "Sleep well."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "낼 잘 봐!!!",
      "en": "See me well tomorrow!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이쁘게 하고 갈게",
      "en": "I'll make sure I look pretty."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "메가콘",
      "en": "At Megacon,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "머리 밝은사람 두명이니까",
      "en": "there'll be two people with bright hair,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘 찾을 수 있을거야",
      "en": "so you'll be able to find me easily."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "두명이야? 너밖에몰라..",
      "en": "Two people? I only know you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 머래 진짱~~~",
      "en": "Ah, what are you saying~~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㅋㄹㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㅋㄹㄹㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘자고",
      "en": "Sleep well."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하랑해~❤️❤️❤️",
      "en": "Haranghae~ ❤️❤️❤️"
    }
  ]
}